    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c016110fbee5a6adc48e880",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是啊，这是救世主写给我的。当时明明还很小，\n却把好多报纸一张张摆开\n照着它们的样子写了出来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0548e828d2216bda8dd52736629585ae3ea3dc5783b012d1233e58a375bb7a11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
