    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da9d35ced862c2d739a6e11e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这里，她总挂在嘴边的……对母亲的敬爱，\n那份感情的根源，仿佛正借着稚拙的图画与文字，\n清清楚楚地呈现在眼前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f535a8362b3ededdc93a0fc0037b25fad40787ced6e950c906e0e43c4c45b136",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
