    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28250474bfb8ac826ac1fc3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然几乎每天都在发送类似的内容，\n我仍重新检查一遍，才点击发送按钮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dcca0f36736f5459e2c1ba852ddaffb5f427f01086fd38b88e87f4673e1fb5a",
