      "uid": "zhcn:975769679c973d91c89f1279",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她接下来带我前往的……\n是位于她家附近的，赛跑教室。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88692ad49b2fe0faf6ff8585afbb3708198ab29ecef2a6af066f5d75b48ce2e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
