      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正如许多退役后走上指导之路的，\n后冠赛马娘前辈，所做的那样――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f357c8823925fa12000f496923d5634adbdf8e3fdb47c9a835d781c4ffd380da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
