    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaa7ac52ecd6fe51f3b3f343",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的母亲也，将负责指导的人数控制在少数，\n重视一对一的教学。\n不仅教导如何活动身体……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b98175606d748425c41252100387989eddfa14b1ae9d07ef8e7f7f538964ff49",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
