    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea9d2e29a71e424a48405e77",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也是如此。经由母亲的双手，\n细致地，一点点塑造成了如今的模样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa83c5e9da61a88a0587875d1a803cc5f6e6044393997b570a4f07fdd084bba1",
