      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在这一瞬间。――空中救世主散发出的气息\n骤然变得尖锐，仿佛迸出了火花。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55837a6ca1b65ff8d4d2704e4f1e676541b9f044ee318bc3486d2c2f2a1239e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
